     "id": "Selesaikan masalah analitik nyata dengan window function (total berjalan, top-N, gaps and islands, sesi), query rekursif, dan belajar membaca execution plan serta merancang index agar query cepat pada 500.000 baris, bukan hanya pada sepuluh.",
     "en": "Solve real analytical problems with window functions (running totals, top-N, gaps and islands, sessions), recursive queries, and learn to read an execution plan and design indexes so the query is fast on 500,000 rows, not just on ten."
