     "en": "Module 0.3 (joins, GROUP BY, NULL, CTEs). You can prototype Part A in the browser SQL Sandbox; to complete the module and generate a proof code, save all 10 Part A queries in `labs/mod-1-3/answers.sql` (checked with Python's built-in SQLite), complete Part B in PostgreSQL (an embedded copy is installed by `pip`, so Docker is optional), and run `python3 scripts/prove.py mod-1-3`."
