     "title": {
      "id": "Lab: bucket lakehouse aman dan perangkat kendali biaya FinOps",
      "en": "Lab: a secure lakehouse bucket and a cost guardrail toolkit"
     },
     "description": {
      "id": "Lab ini terbagi menjadi dua bagian: Bagian A melengkapi konfigurasi Terraform hingga menghasilkan execution plan offline yang memvalidasi bahwa storage bucket S3 lakehouse Anda terisolasi privat, terenkripsi KMS kustom, memiliki aturan lifecycle otomatis, bertag lengkap, dan hanya dapat diakses melalui kebijakan least-privilege. Bagian B membangun fungsi-fungsi Python untuk kendali FinOps: pemodelan penagihan warehouse, alokasi biaya per tim, deteksi query liar berbasis median, forecasting proyeksi anggaran, serta simulasi analisis tiering penyimpanan data.",
      "en": "Part A: finish a Terraform configuration until an offline plan proves the bucket is private, encrypted, lifecycle-managed, tagged and accessible only through a least-privilege policy. Part B: write the Python functions behind your FinOps controls: warehouse billing, cost by team, runaway detection, a budget forecast and storage tiering."
     },
     "steps": {
      "id": "> Sudah menyelesaikan Bagian A dan B lewat Jeda Praktik 1–4? Langsung loncat ke Langkah 7 dan Jeda Praktik 5 untuk memverifikasi kedua suite pengujian dan menghasilkan kode bukti.\n\n1. Instal pytest dan Terraform CLI (versi 1.5 atau lebih baru; atau OpenTofu). Pasang direktori cache plugin agar proses pengunduhan provider tidak diulang berkali-kali:\n\n```bash\npython -m pip install -r labs/mod-3-4/requirements.txt\nexport TF_PLUGIN_CACHE_DIR=$HOME/.terraform.d/plugin-cache && mkdir -p \"$TF_PLUGIN_CACHE_DIR\"\npytest labs/mod-3-4 -v          # seluruh pengujian awal akan gagal\n```\n\n2. **Bagian A: Infrastruktur Lakehouse.** Buka direktori `labs/mod-3-4/terraform/`. File `versions.tf`, `provider.tf`, serta file `.tfvars` dev dan prod telah disediakan. Deklarasikan variabel input di `variables.tf`, lalu selesaikan daftar instruksi TODO di file `main.tf` dan `outputs.tf`.\n3. Gunakan Terraform CLI lokal secara interaktif saat menulis kode: `cd labs/mod-3-4/terraform && terraform init -backend=false && terraform validate && terraform plan -var-file=dev.tfvars`. Tinjau output plan layaknya seorang code reviewer. Jalankan perintah `terraform fmt` sebelum menjalankan pengujian otomatis.\n4. Eksekusi pengujian Bagian A via `pytest labs/mod-3-4/test_terraform.py -v`. Pengujian akan membedah representasi JSON dari artefak plan untuk lingkungan dev dan prod.\n5. Cermati pengujian kebijakan IAM policy. Pengujian ini menegaskan aksi yang presisi, pembatasan target direktori, dan kondisi awalan `s3:prefix`. Amati bagaimana penggunaan nama bucket langsung memungkinkan evaluasi policy secara transparan pada tahap plan.\n6. **Bagian B: Toolkit Kendali Biaya FinOps.** Buka `labs/mod-3-4/finops.py` dan implementasikan keenam fungsi analitik biaya (`query_cost`, `billed_seconds`, `cost_by_tag`, `find_runaway`, `forecast_month`, `storage_cost`). Data log query berasal dari generator deterministik `labs/shared/querylog.py`. Jalankan pengujian otomatis via `pytest labs/mod-3-4/test_finops.py -v`.\n7. Eksplorasi mandiri: gunakan fungsi yang telah Anda bangun untuk menganalisis durasi auto-suspend mana yang paling optimal; identifikasi tim pemilik query liar 11 jam; kalkulasikan akumulasi biaya harian dan uji fungsi `forecast_month` dengan target anggaran $75 pada hari ke-15 dan hari ke-16 (saat query liar terjadi). Pahami mengapa proyeksi hari ke-16 bersifat pesimistis dan bagaimana integrasi `find_runaway` mampu menormalisasi prakiraan tersebut.\n\n> 💡 **Jeda Praktik 5 (Verifikasi Lengkap & Bukti Kelulusan):**\n> 1. Di terminal, jalankan kedua rangkaian uji Terraform (Bagian A) dan FinOps (Bagian B):\n>    `pytest labs/mod-3-4/test_terraform.py labs/mod-3-4/test_finops.py -v`\n> 2. Hasilkan token bukti verifikasi (membutuhkan Terraform CLI agar Bagian A tidak dilewati):\n>    `python3 scripts/prove.py mod-3-4`\n> 3. **Indikator Sukses:** Seluruh 41 pengujian (12 Terraform + 29 FinOps) lulus dan token bukti kelulusan dicetak ke terminal untuk verifikasi.",
      "en": "> Already finished Parts A and B during Practice Pauses 1–4? Skip straight to Step 7 and Practice Pause 5 to verify both suites and generate your proof token.\n\n1. Install pytest and the Terraform CLI (1.5 or newer, from developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/install, or OpenTofu). Reuse the heavy provider download across runs:\n\n```bash\npython -m pip install -r labs/mod-3-4/requirements.txt\nexport TF_PLUGIN_CACHE_DIR=$HOME/.terraform.d/plugin-cache && mkdir -p \"$TF_PLUGIN_CACHE_DIR\"\npytest labs/mod-3-4 -v          # the starter fails at first\n```\n\n2. **Part A.** In `labs/mod-3-4/terraform/`, `versions.tf`, `provider.tf` and the two `.tfvars` files are provided (read `provider.tf`: why does `plan` work with no AWS account?). Declare the variables in `variables.tf`, then follow the TODO list in `main.tf` and `outputs.tf`.\n3. Work with the real CLI while you write: `cd labs/mod-3-4/terraform && terraform init -backend=false && terraform validate && terraform plan -var-file=dev.tfvars`. Read the plan as a reviewer would. Run `terraform fmt` before testing, since formatting is one of the tests.\n4. Run `pytest labs/mod-3-4/test_terraform.py -v` (about 30 seconds after the first provider download). The tests inspect `terraform show -json` of the dev and prod plans.\n5. Read the failing test for the IAM policy carefully. It asserts the exact actions, resources and the `s3:prefix` condition. Replace `local.bucket_arn` with `aws_s3_bucket.lakehouse.arn` and look at the plan: the policy turns into \"known after apply\".\n6. **Part B.** Open `labs/mod-3-4/finops.py` and implement the six functions (`query_cost`, `billed_seconds`, `cost_by_tag`, `find_runaway`, `forecast_month`, `storage_cost`). The query log comes from `labs/shared/querylog.py`: print the first rows and the largest query before you start. Run `pytest labs/mod-3-4/test_finops.py -v`.\n7. Use your functions to answer: what auto-suspend would you choose for the shared warehouse and why? Which team paid for the 11-hour query? Add up each day's cost and try `forecast_month` with a $75 budget: what does it say on day 15, and on day 16 (the day the runaway starts)? Why is the day-16 forecast too pessimistic, and how could `find_runaway` improve it?\n\n> 💡 **Practice Pause 5 (Full Verification & Proof Token):**\n> 1. In terminal, run both the Terraform (Part A) and FinOps (Part B) test suites:\n>    `pytest labs/mod-3-4/test_terraform.py labs/mod-3-4/test_finops.py -v`\n> 2. Generate the verification proof token (requires Terraform CLI installed so Part A is not skipped):\n>    `python3 scripts/prove.py mod-3-4`\n> 3. **Success Indicator:** All 41 tests (12 Terraform + 29 FinOps) report `PASSED` and your completion proof token is printed to terminal."
     },
